UsageMesh v2.2.0

- Harden dashboard secret handling: workspace keys stay only in page memory.
- Preserve existing dashboard passwords and legacy 310k PBKDF2 access manifests.
- Use 600k PBKDF2 for new or explicitly changed dashboard passwords.
- Add restrictive CSP and referrer policy for the static dashboard.
- Recover explicit reasoning/thinking effort metadata across supported text-based clients without guessing.
